    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Poliga Poliga: The Life History of Sri Ramanuja&quot; chronicles the remarkable journey of the revered philosopher and theologian, Sri Ramanuja. From a divine light that emerged with the sound of a cosmic upheaval to his incarnations as Lakshmana and Nammalvar, the book captures the essence of Ramanuja&apos;s life and teachings. Through vivid descriptions, it portrays his transformative impact, including his role in bringing forth the message of divine grace and devotion. Originally serialized in the Daily Thanthi newspaper over 108 days, this inspiring narrative has garnered widespread acclaim and continues to resonate with readers.</marc:subfield>
